# Gemini API key (optional).
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Without a key the app uses the built-in faker generator; users can
# also paste their own key in the UI at request time.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Copy this file to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in your key:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
